=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/51-55.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Adh-Dhaariyat 51:55 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Dan tetap tekunlah engkau memberi peringatan, kerana sesungguhnya peringatan itu mendatangkan faedah kepada orang-orang yang beriman.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Laman utama\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Adh-Dhaariyat\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/surah/51.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Ayat 55\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/51-55.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> › <a href=\"/ms/surah/51.html\">Surah Adh-Dhaariyat</a> › Ayat 55</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Adh-Dhaariyat 51:55</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَذَكِّرْ فَإِنَّ الذِّكْرَىٰ تَنفَعُ الْمُؤْمِنِينَ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemahan makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Dan tetap tekunlah engkau memberi peringatan, kerana sesungguhnya peringatan itu mendatangkan faedah kepada orang-orang yang beriman.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Malay Translation - Abdullah Basumayyah — v1.0.0 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Kata-kata kedua-dua imam dipaparkan dalam bahasa Arab asal, kata demi kata, berserta rujukan.</p><section><h2>Syeikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">والنفع نوعان: حصول النعمة واندفاع النقمة.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/184</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وهذا التام النافع يخص به المؤمنين المنتفعين. فهم إذا آمنوا ذكرهم بما أنزل وكلما أنزل شيء من القرآن ذكرهم به ويذكرهم بمعانيه ويذكرهم بما نزل قبل ذلك.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/163</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فهو إذا بلغ قوما الرسالة فقامت الحجة عليهم ثم امتنعوا من سماع كلامه أعرض عنهم. فإن الذكرى حينئذ لا تنفع أحدا.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/163</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ms#s51a55\">Buka dalam tafsir interaktif (teks penuh)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ms/ayah/51-49.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (51:49)</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/51-56.html\">Ayat seterusnya (51:56)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang projek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; terma</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/51-56.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ms\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Adh-Dhaariyat 51:56 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Dan (ingatlah) Aku tidak menciptakan jin dan manusia melainkan untuk mereka menyembah dan beribadat kepadaKu.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/51-56.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Adh-Dhaariyat 51:56 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Dan (ingatlah) Aku tidak menciptakan jin dan manusia melainkan untuk mereka menyembah dan beribadat kepadaKu.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Laman utama\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Adh-Dhaariyat\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/surah/51.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Ayat 56\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/51-56.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> › <a href=\"/ms/surah/51.html\">Surah Adh-Dhaariyat</a> › Ayat 56</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Adh-Dhaariyat 51:56</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَمَا خَلَقْتُ الْجِنَّ وَالْإِنسَ إِلَّا لِيَعْبُدُونِ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemahan makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Dan (ingatlah) Aku tidak menciptakan jin dan manusia melainkan untuk mereka menyembah dan beribadat kepadaKu.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Malay Translation - Abdullah Basumayyah — v1.0.0 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Kata-kata kedua-dua imam dipaparkan dalam bahasa Arab asal, kata demi kata, berserta rujukan.</p><section><h2>Syeikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">والإجابة والاستجابة هي طاعة الأمر والنهي وهي العبادة التي خلق لها الثقلان؛ كما قال تعالى: {وما خلقت الجن والإنس إلا ليعبدون} .<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 4/235</cite></blockquote><h3>Apa yang beliau nukilkan daripada orang lain</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">مجاهد</span> <span class=\"st\">حكاه</span> «لآمرهم وأنهاهم»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 8/52</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">زيد بن أسلم</span> <span class=\"st\">حكاه</span> «جبلهم على الشقاوة والسعادة»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 8/45</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">علي بن أبي طالب</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «إلا لآمرهم أن يعبدون وأدعوهم إلى عبادتي.»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 8/52</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibnu al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فالعبادة هي الغاية التي خلق لها الجن والإنس والخلائق كلها<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 1/118</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فأخبر أنه لم يخلق الجن والإنس لحاجة منه إليهم، ولا ليربح عليهم، لكن خلقهم جودا وإحسانا ليعبدوه فيربحوا هم عليه كل الأرباح<cite>«طريق الهجرتين وباب السعادتين» 1/135</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ms#s51a56\">Buka dalam tafsir interaktif (teks penuh)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ms/ayah/51-55.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (51:55)</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/51-57.html\">Ayat seterusnya (51:57)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang projek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; terma</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/51-57.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ms\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Adh-Dhaariyat 51:57 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim</title>\n<m